This project adapts code and ideas from scout (https://github.com/ethanyanghq/scout) by Ethan Yang,
used and adapted with the author's explicit permission. The upstream repository has no license
file; the author's permission is the basis for this use. Adapted code was taken from commit
60f567b89916edb908129c868e3dd4be664b0e07 and lives in its own git commits titled
"import from scout (used with author permission)". Every adapted file starts with a header naming
its upstream source and what we changed:

  src/transport/linq/api.ts        ← bridge/linq-api.ts
  src/transport/linq/events.ts     ← bridge/linq.ts (event mapping)
  src/transport/linq/platform.ts   ← bridge/linq.ts (platform + send dispatcher)
  src/transport/tapbacks.ts        ← bridge/tapbacks.ts
  src/transport/sim/platform.ts    ← bridge/devchat/platform.ts
  src/sim/script.ts                ← bridge/devchat/script.ts (.chat format)
  src/agent/addressed.ts           ← src/scout/speak_gate.py, src/scout/trip.py
  src/agent/speakGate.ts           ← src/scout/speak_gate.py
  src/money/split.ts               ← src/scout/expense_split.py
  src/money/settle.ts              ← src/scout/settle_up.py
  src/trips/votes.ts               ← src/scout/polls.py

